  id: heatdebt
  title: 13. The Interest Keeps Rising
  region: Red Escrow Mesa
  briefing: Recover four physical grid keys from abandoned cooling substations during
    a dust storm. Their optical backup links cannot be disabled remotely.
  opening: 'Bea: Sunsprawl called the takeover a wellness transition. They are turning
    off neighborhood cooling at noon unless people refinance their cars.'
  midpoint: 'Mara: The first ledger includes a small unpaid repair. They used it
    to buy our customer''s debt. That invoice is the legal fault in their whole acquisition
    chain.'
  closing: 'Bea: Four keys recovered. We have a way in and one spectacularly petty
    accounting discrepancy.'
  optionalObjective: Recover 3 roadside salvage caches
